Nature of the modifications: the upstream evaluation tooling was hardwired to
the Claude CLI (`claude -p`) and Claude Code subagents. It has been adapted to
the `agy` (antigravity CLI) engine and to Hermes `delegate_task` for parallel
evaluation, and to Hermes skill conventions and frontmatter. Upstream
`run_eval.py`, `run_loop.py` and `improve_description.py` were merged and
rewritten into `scripts/run_description_optimization.py`, which is a new file
and not derived from upstream.

